1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:01,903
You bought a minivan?!

2
00:00:01,902 --> 00:00:03,932
(Howard:)It's for the baby,
and I didn't buy it.

3
00:00:03,937 --> 00:00:05,357
(Howard:)The dealer
loaned it to me

4
00:00:05,355 --> 00:00:07,485
(Howard:)for a 24-hour test drive.

5
00:00:07,491 --> 00:00:09,571
(Raj:)Though we did ding up the back
pretty good with the crib,

6
00:00:09,576 --> 00:00:11,276
(Raj:)so you might have
bought a minivan.

7
00:00:12,946 --> 00:00:15,576
(Bernadette:)I don't want to drive that.
It's such a mom car.

8
00:00:15,582 --> 00:00:17,252
(Howard:)The guy at the dealership said

9
00:00:17,250 --> 00:00:19,250
(Howard:)they're not just
for moms anymore.

10
00:00:19,252 --> 00:00:20,282
(Raj:)Then again,

11
00:00:20,287 --> 00:00:22,787
(Raj:)he did think
you were my husband.

12
00:00:25,175 --> 00:00:26,955
(Bernadette:)They thought it
at the ultrasound.

13
00:00:26,960 --> 00:00:28,840
(Bernadette:)Why not at the car dealership?

14
00:00:34,718 --> 00:00:37,298
(Leonard:)Never been on this side
of the table before.

15
00:00:37,304 --> 00:00:39,524
(Leonard:)I feel powerful.

16
00:00:39,523 --> 00:00:40,973
(Penny:)Really?

17
00:00:40,974 --> 00:00:45,024
(Penny:)I feel like I'm selling candy so
our team can get new uniforms.

18
00:00:45,028 --> 00:00:48,058
Okay, so it's $4.75
for a signed black-and-white

19
00:00:48,064 --> 00:00:49,314
and $9.95 for a color.

20
00:00:49,316 --> 00:00:51,486
(Penny:)Right. Why not five
and ten bucks?

21
00:00:51,484 --> 00:00:54,324
(Leonard:)Well, I brought my moneymaker.
Let me shake it.

22
00:00:55,822 --> 00:00:57,402
(Penny:)Hey, that guy's
looking over here.

23
00:00:57,407 --> 00:00:58,987
(Leonard:)Oh. You think
he's your first autograph?

24
00:00:58,992 --> 00:01:01,162
(Penny:)I don't know. Be cool.
He's coming. He's coming.

